      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCKERBIE (1) jumps from box 1 for the first time after placing latest at Angle Park (31.26) in a Grade 6. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to feature in the finish again. VICTA GRAHAM (7) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 19.18. Draws out wide but in form and has the ability. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Likely to be in the finish. ARCHIE'S BOY (5) scored his maiden success two back then hit the frame last time when second and beaten 1.5 lengths at Gawler over 400m (23.17). Has two places this course. Bold showing expected again. BRINK AND BACK (3) will be hard to beat with a drop in journey.",
